      "message": "The Neutron 502 was caused by repeated certificate_available events from\nthe update-status refresh. Even when the certificate was unchanged, each\nevent triggered configure_charm(), replanning the Neutron WSGI service.\nRequests reaching Traefik during the restart failed with backend EOF and\nwere returned as 502.\n\nThe patch now deduplicates unchanged certificate bundles, prevents\nsynchronous certificate callback re-entry, and only records a bundle as\nhandled after charm configuration completes successfully. Real certificate\nrenewals still trigger reconciliation.",
